    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muanjelo wa Yehowa wakafuma ku Gilegala, wakaya ku Bokima. Yeye wakamba ne, Nakanûmusha mu Ejipitu, nakalua nʼenu ku buloba bunakalaya bankambua benu; nakamba ne, Tshiena nshiha tshihungidi tshinakahunga nʼenu tshiendelele; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nuenu kanuhungi tshihungidi ne bena buloba ebu; nutonkole bioshelu biabo. Kadi nuenu kanuakatumikila dî dianyi; nuakuenza nunku bua tshinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua bualu ebu nakanuambila kahidi ne, Tshiena mbihata ku mpala kuenu, kadi bobo nebikale bu meba mu mbese yenu, ne nzambi yabo neyikale bu buteyi kunudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe bakambila muanjelo wa Yehowa Bena Isalele bonso mei â, bobo bakaha miadi, bakadila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bakidika muaba au ne, Bokima; bakashihelaku Yehowa nyama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe bakatuma Yoshua bantu, Bena Isalele bonso bakaya muntu ku buhianyi buandi muntu ku buhianyi buandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bonso bakakuatshila Yehowa mudimu matuku onso a Yoshua, ne a bakulu bakadi bashala ne muoyo ku nyima kua Yoshua, bakatangilaku malu manene onso akenzela Yehowa Bena Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua, muana mulume wa Nuna, muntu wa Yehowa, wakafua hakadiye ne bidimu lukama ne dikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamujika ku mukalu wa buhianyi buandi mu Timenatahelese, ku mikuna ya mu Efelayima, ku nôde kua mukuna wa Gasha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bonso ba mu tshikondo atshi bakasangishibua kudi bankambua babo kabidi, ne ba mu tshikondo tshikuabo tshiakabalonda ku nyima kabakamanya Yehowa anyi mudimu munene wakenzeleye Bena Isalele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Isalele bakenza malu akadi mabi ku mesu kua Yehowa, bakakuatshila Bala mudimu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakalekela Yehowa Nzambi wa batatuʼabo, wakafunda nʼabo mu buloba bua Ejipitu; bakalonda nzambi mikuabo, nzambi ya bantu bakadi ha buihi nʼabo, bakayinamina; bakafikisha Yehowa munda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakalekela Yehowa, bakakuatshila Bala ne Ashatelota mudimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshiji tshia Yehowa tshiakadi kudi Bena Isalele, ne yeye wakabafila mu bianza bia bahandi, bakabahaula; yeye wakabahana kudi bena lukuna bakadi ha buihi nʼabo; kabakamanya mua kuimana ku mpala kua bena lukuna babo kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuonso kuakayabo tshianza tshia Yehowa tshiakadi kudibo bua kubenzela bibi bu muakamba Yehowa, ne bu muakaditshiha Yehowa kudibo; bakadi ne ntatu ya bungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakabisha balumbuluishi, bakabasungila mu bianza bia bakadi babahaula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bobo kabakunvuila balumbuluishi babo; kadi bakenza malu a masandi kudi nzambi yabo, bakayinamina; bobo bakasesuka lubilu mu nshila wakadi batatuʼabo bendamu hakadibo batumikila mikenji ya Yehowa; kadi bobo kabakenza nunku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakababishila Yehowa mulumbuluishi, hashishe Yehowa wakadi ne mulumbuluishi eu, wakabasungila mu bianza bia bena lukuna babo matuku onso a mulumbuluishi eu; bualu bua Yehowa wakadi ukudimuna mutshima wandi bualu bua kutua kua mikemu yabo yakatuabo hakadibo babakengesha ne hakadibo babatatshisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi hakafua mulumbuluishi, hashishe bobo bakalukila ku nyima, bakatamba batatuʼabo kuenza bibi, hakalondabo nzambi mikuabo bua kuyenzela mudimu ne bua kuyinamina; kabakalekela bienzedi biabo bibi anyi tshitshu tshiabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshiji tshia Yehowa tshiakadi kudi Bena Isalele kabidi, ne yeye wakamba ne, Bualu bua tshisamba etshi tshiakashiha tshihungidi tshinakahunga ne batatuʼabo, kabakunvua dî dianyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "meme kabidi tshiena ngihata bisamba bia bantu ku mpala kuabo, biakashiya Yoshua hakafueye: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua meme kuteta nʼabo Bena Isalele bua kumanya ne bobo nebalamate nshila wa Yehowa bua kuendamu bu muakenza batatuʼabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Yehowa wakashiya bisamba abi bia bantu mu buloba, kakabihata lubilu; yeye kabidi kakabafila mu tshianza tshia Yoshua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
